{%- comment -%}
  schema-collection, CollectionPage + ItemList for one collection page.

  Added 10/09/2026 (W331). Collection pages emitted JewelryStore and
  BreadcrumbList only, so the grid itself, which is the whole point of the
  page, was not described at all.

  RENDERED FROM sections/main-collection.liquid, immediately after the grid,
  INSIDE the paginate block:

      {%- render 'schema-collection',
            collection: collection, products: collection.products,
            paginate: paginate -%}

  Not from layout/theme.liquid like schema-product and schema-article, and for
  the same reason BreadcrumbList is not: this describes what is actually
  rendered. The head has no paginate, so it cannot know whether this is page 1
  of 24 products or page 3, and an ItemList that disagrees with the page is
  worse than none.

  What it says, and why:
    - `position` is absolute across the whole collection, not 1-24 again on
      every page: paginate.current_offset + the loop index. Two pages both
      claiming position 1 is the usual way this markup goes wrong.
    - Entries are url + name only. Google reads the linked product page for
      price and availability, which schema-product already states properly,
      and repeating a price here is a second source to drift.
    - `numberOfItems` is the count on THIS page, which is what ItemList means.
      The collection total goes on the CollectionPage as a plain description
      line, not as a number that contradicts the list.
    - Absolute URLs: `product.url` is a path, and Google wants the full URL.
    - A filtered or empty grid emits nothing. A list of nothing is not useful,
      and filter views are not canonical pages.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign c = collection
  assign items = products
  assign skip = false
  if c == blank or items == blank or items.size == 0
    assign skip = true
  endif
  assign offset = 0
  if paginate != blank
    assign offset = paginate.current_offset
  endif
  assign coll_desc = c.description | strip_html | strip_newlines | strip | truncate: 300
-%}
{%- unless skip -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "@id": {{ canonical_url | append: '#collection' | json }},
  "url": {{ canonical_url | json }},
  "name": {{ c.title | json }},
  {%- if coll_desc != blank %}
  "description": {{ coll_desc | json }},
  {%- endif %}
  "isPartOf": { "@id": {{ shop.url | append: '/#business' | json }} },
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "numberOfItems": {{ items.size }},
    "itemListOrder": "https://schema.org/ItemListOrderAscending",
    "itemListElement": [
      {%- for item in items -%}
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": {{ offset | plus: forloop.index }},
        "url": {{ item.url | prepend: shop.url | json }},
        "name": {{ item.title | json }}
      }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  }
}
</script>
{%- endunless -%}
